# RoadWise — repository hygiene
#
# Citizen-submitted evidence photos are operational data, not source. They are
# uploaded at runtime (Supabase Storage is the active store; the local directory
# is only used by the legacy /api/reports/image/{filename} endpoint), so they must
# never be committed. 77 of them were tracked until this file existed, putting
# resident-supplied imagery into the repository history.
backend-master/backend-master/uploads/*
!backend-master/backend-master/uploads/.gitkeep

# Editor and IDE state
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr

# Build and dependency output
node_modules/
dist/
target/
build/
*.class
*.log

# Local tooling
mvnw.zip
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
AGENTS.md
AGENTS.md.v4-migration.lock
LEAN-CTX.md
LEAN-CTX.md.v4-migration.lock
